# Testman's back throw (4a+b) releases the opponent 75000 behind the thrower: p2 back-throws p1 to the far side.
setup: p1 character testman
setup: p2 character testman
setup: p1 x = -30000
setup: p2 x = 30000

frame 1: p2 4a+b

frame 1: expect p2 move = back_throw
frame 10: expect p2 event throw_hit
frame 10: expect p1 damage = 1200
frame 10: expect p1 x = 105000
